WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:01.416
- I’ve got some bad news.

00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:03.833
We’re going to practice in a blizzard again even though we play inside.

00:00:03.916 --> 00:00:05.416
- You don’t listen, do you?

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.208
You ask: Do you have any impressive stats? 

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:10.458
All I have are stats.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.708
Megatron always tells me to be like the Lions greats and retire early.

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:19.833
- Ladies and Gentlemen, PAD STATFORD.

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:22.125
- What's the most reliable Ford in Detroit?  

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.625
A STAF FORD.

00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:25.666
- OK, I like dad jokes, and I did not like that!

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:28.250
- Do you wanna know how I got these scars?

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:29.375
- You’re combining Jokers. 

00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:31.541
- I’ve had a broken back, torn finger ligaments—

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:35.416
My whole career I didn’t know if I existed, but I do.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.750
HAHAHA WE ALMOST BEAT THE CHIEFS!

00:00:38.791 --> 00:00:41.666
And other disenfranchised QBs are starting to notice.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.583
Hello, Rodgers…

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.875
- AHHH. Oh, I thought it was someone scary like the Bears.

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:45.833
- Hahaha, good joke—

00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:46.833
- DON’T YOU LAUGH AT ME, LAFLEUR. 

00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:49.708
- I used to think the Lions were a tragedy, 

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.833
but now I realize they’re a comedy.

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:53.958
Can you introduce me as… 

00:00:54.041 --> 00:00:54.750
- THE CHOKER.

00:00:55.166 --> 00:00:55.500
- No, I—

00:00:55.541 --> 00:00:56.541
- THE MEDIOCRE.

00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:57.833
- THE CAN’T-TAKE-A-JOKER

00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:59.833
- Can you guys just let me have one thing? 

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:03.541
- HEY, YOU.

00:01:03.541 --> 00:01:05.375
YEAH, ALL FREAKIN’ HUNDREDS OF THOUSANDS OF YOU

00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:06.375
Flipping listen to me.

00:01:06.375 --> 00:01:09.291
I’m P.O.’d about the M.F.ing lurkers watching our B.S.

00:01:09.291 --> 00:01:12.083
So subscribe to this G.D. channel or G.T. the Fluff O.

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.333
DADDY SAYS SUBSCRIBE.

